      "writtenOn": "2021-05-06T19:09:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If we\u0027re not too worried about diverging from legacy behavior, how do you feel about only undoing bad compression when writing binary APK files in `convert` and `link`?\n\nIMO, we should either explicitly track desired compression status, or never alter it with these kinds of optimizations in intermediate APKs.",
      "parentUuid": "b47f0a10_34c3a1eb",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 40,
        "startChar": 4,
